cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness, its corpus, or its detection method, please cite it."
title: "fsi-eval-harness: a verify-and-regenerate loop for LLM output on regulated financial data"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic verifier that checks every numeric GAAP claim an LLM makes against XBRL
  ground truth, a narrative grounding gate with a measured false-ground floor, and a
  194-item blinded error-injection corpus with held-out labels for measuring whether an
  evaluator can fail at all.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Avinash
    family-names: Saraswat
    affiliation: "Independent, personal capacity"
repository-code: "https://github.com/avinashsaraswat/fsi-eval-harness"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - LLM evaluation
  - error injection
  - AI assurance
  - model risk
  - XBRL
  - financial reporting
